---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <div class="content article-page">
    <div class="card">
      <h1>New War Tool: Auto-Hit Feature in MyProfitLand</h1>
      <p class="meta">auth : <span class="gold-text">Mina Boles</span> | published on Feb 16, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <img class="article-image" src="/imgs/autohitmina.jpeg" alt="Auto-Hit Feature" />
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <p>
        <strong>MyProfitLand</strong> has introduced an exciting new feature that will change the way wars are fought in the game. On February 16, 2026, the game admin announced the addition of the **Auto-Hit** tool, a game-changer for players who want to take part in wars while staying AFK (away from keyboard).
      </p>

      <h3>What is the Auto-Hit Feature?</h3>
      <p>
        The new **Auto-Hit** feature allows players to attack or defend automatically based on the settings they configure. The system will automatically deal damage during war, so you can focus on other activities while still making progress in the game. It’s a perfect tool for those who want to manage their time better, but still want to be involved in the action!
      </p>

      <p>
        Here’s how it works:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>Auto-Damage:</strong> When you enter a war, you will now see a robot icon next to the red “deal damage” button. Clicking this icon enables the auto-hit mode, allowing the game to perform actions on autopilot.</li>
                <img class= "article-image" src="imgs/IMG_6714.jpeg" alt="">
        <li><strong>Consumables Use:</strong> The Auto-Hit tool can also use consumables like **coffee** and **mocaccinos** to keep you going during battle without manual intervention.</li>
                       <img class= "article-image" src="imgs/autihitsettings.jpeg" alt="">

<li><strong>AFK Option:</strong> You can essentially stock up on weapons and drinks and let the system do the damage for you while you go AFK—although, of course, there's always a risk of taking a bomb or facing other challenges while away.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>How to Use Auto-Hit?</h3>
      <p>
        To activate Auto-Hit, you’ll need to pay a small **sVCT fee** per war. This fee grants you access to the automatic damage feature for that particular war, helping you stay active in the game without constantly being at the controls.
      </p>
                <img class= "article-image" src="imgs/autohit.jpeg" alt="">


      <h3>ReCaptcha for Fair Play</h3>
      <p>
        To maintain fairness and prevent illegal bots from taking advantage of the system, **reCaptcha** has been re-enabled for normal war damage. This ensures that only legitimate players are using the Auto-Hit feature, keeping the gameplay environment clean and competitive.
      </p>

      <p>
        With this new feature, MyProfitLand gives players a fresh approach to engaging in wars, while providing a more flexible and automated gaming experience. It’s an exciting step forward in the game’s evolution, allowing players to focus on strategy while the system handles the damage!
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
